{"uid":"7aa0c25aa18e8a0c","name":"The same without the iframe: the popup is offered, the burnt token is never sent a second time, \"Sign in again\" needs no password","fullName":"application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.SignInAgainPopupTest.burntToken_withoutIframe_popupThenSignInAgainWithoutPassword","historyId":"bc410c4750039a6b89f0889e39438da2","time":{"start":1795539998403,"stop":1795540016329,"duration":17926},"description":"The silent renewal is told apart from an ordinary sign in by prompt=none, and here it is made unreachable: this is the application at a customer whose provider sits on another site, where the browser keeps its cookie out of the iframe. The renewal has then no way left: the refresh token is burnt after its one failure and the popup is offered. What must not happen is a second request with that same token - the reuse that ends the whole session. \"Sign in again\" is a full page redirect, the cookie goes with it, and the user is back without a login page.","descriptionHtml":"The silent renewal is told apart from an ordinary sign in by prompt=none, and here it is made unreachable: this is the application at a customer whose provider sits on another site, where the browser keeps its cookie out of the iframe. The renewal has then no way left: the refresh token is burnt after its one failure and the popup is offered. What must not happen is a second request with that same token - the reuse that ends the whole session. \"Sign in again\" is a full page redirect, the cookie goes with it, and the user is back without a login page.\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Manual run:</strong> <code>  \uD83D\uDCCB Copy  application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.SignInAgainPopupTest#burntToken_withoutIframe_popupThenSignInAgainWithoutPassword </code> into <a href=\"https://github.com/CX-Box/cxbox-code-samples/actions/workflows/build_button_qa.yml\">GitHub Actions</a> → <strong>Run Workflow</strong> → <strong>include PATH</strong>","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":fa